13	 * <p>Normalization strips spaces, dashes and brackets, then forms the canonical E.164 string:
14	 * <ul>
15	 *   <li>a leading {@code '+'} and country code are kept as-is;</li>
16	 *   <li>otherwise country code {@code +61} is assumed and a single leading {@code '0'} is dropped from
17	 *       the national digits.</li>
